### Key points

- **`hasMore` controls visibility.** The button is rendered conditionally (`hasMore && ...`), not just hidden or disabled.
- **Determining `hasMore`:** Prefer an explicit flag or cursor from the API. The fallback `items.length === pageSize` works, but it costs one extra empty fetch when the total is an exact multiple of the page size. If your API returns a `total`, use `items.length < total` instead.
